{"id":"3ec173dab9734388","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-effective-simple.md","title":"有效简单集合","display":"df-effective-simple — 有效简单集合","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-effective-simple","aliases":["20-df-effective-simple"],"display":"df-effective-simple — 有效简单集合","chapter":"5","section":"5.2","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 5.2.4","source_pdf_pages":[145],"source_printed_pages":[110],"depends_on":["[[20-df-simple]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-effective-simple"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-effective-simple</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-effective-simple — 有效简单集合"},{"key":"chapter","html":"5"},{"key":"section","html":"5.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 5.2.4"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>145</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>110</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"428fc565e7338639\" href=\"?note=428fc565e7338639\" title=\"20-df-simple\">20-df-simple</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"428fc565e7338639\" href=\"?note=428fc565e7338639\" title=\"20-df-simple\">20-df-simple</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<p>上标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{tot}\">\\(\\mathrm{tot}\\)</span> 表示全定义限制：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\">\\(\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\\)</span>；相对族采用同一限制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}simple}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{EffectivelySimple}(A)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Simple}(A)\\land\\exists b\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\\n\\forall e\\ [W_e\\subseteq\\omega\\setminus A\\Rightarrow |W_e|\\le b(e)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}simple}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{EffectivelySimple}(A)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Simple}(A)\\land\\exists b\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\\n\\forall e\\ [W_e\\subseteq\\omega\\setminus A\\Rightarrow |W_e|\\le b(e)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是对补集中每个 c.e. 子集的基数作统一有效界。用严格界 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|W_e|&lt;b(e)\">\\(|W_e|&lt;b(e)\\)</span> 的原书约定可通过加 1 转换。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 5.2.4；印刷页 110；PDF 第 145 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-simple","status":"resolved","id":"428fc565e7338639","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-simple]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-simple","status":"resolved","id":"428fc565e7338639","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-simple]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-simple]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{tot}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}simple}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{EffectivelySimple}(A)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Simple}(A)\\land\\exists b\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\\n\\forall e\\ [W_e\\subseteq\\omega\\setminus A\\Rightarrow |W_e|\\le b(e)].","display":true},{"tex":"|W_e|<b(e)","display":false}],"bytes":1274,"backlinks":[{"id":"b5b64991d8dc3e7d","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-immune]]；see [[20-df-effective-simple]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。"},{"id":"2a3b5d1c6d48163f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-effective-simple]]；see [[20-df-movable-markers]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。"},{"id":"91e419d6023b31d0","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-effective-simple]]；see [[20-df-K]]；see [[20-df-tred]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-df-movable-markers]]；see [[20-thm-recursion-parameters]]；see [[20-thm-K-one-complete]]。"},{"id":"0ddc2f4aa380ea29","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-simple]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-df-effective-simple]]；see [[20-df-principal-function]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-114","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-effective-simple]] — 章 5；直接提供者 2 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-114","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-effective-simple]]"}],"outgoing":["428fc565e7338639","e343870c773cb68e"]}